+/// Reuse a coherent tier-1 observation without allocating profiling state.
+/// The operator must match, and both operands still receive exact-integer
+/// guards at the original instruction. A cache change can reject emission;
+/// it cannot turn an observed lane into an unchecked runtime assumption.
+fn observed_integer_operands(
+    code: &CodeObject,
+    pc: u32,
+    kind: ArithKind,
+    a: JitType,
+    b: JitType,
